<p>Hi,</p>

<p><%= @sender.name %> has invited you to join the <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong> organization on Tribely.</p>

<p>To accept this invitation, please click the link below:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Accept Invitation", accept_invitation_url(token: @invitation.token) %></p>

<p>If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>Thanks,</p>
<p>The Tribely Team</p>
